<title>USA: Optical Cable wins 140,000 ft cable order.</title>
<headline>Optical Cable wins 140,000 ft cable order.</headline>
<dateline>ROANOKE, Va. 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Optical Cable Corp said on Tuesday it received an order from a large German global systems integrator to supply 140,000 feet of multi-mode fiber optic cable.</p>
<p>Optical Cable said in a statement the integrator would put its private label on the cables. It declined to name the integrator or the financial value of the order.</p>
<p>The order was for Optical's &quot;Core-Locked&quot; Breakout &quot;B&quot; series cable, the company said.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
